OL,3,ARare Suffragette Christmas card from
OL,4,A1910 found at roadshow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare Suffragette Christmas card from
OL,7,Faround 1910 has been discovered at a
OL,8,Fvintage roadshow.
OL,10,FThe card, found in Mold, Flintshire,
OL,11,Fand which comes from the height of the
OL,12,Fcampaign to win women the vote, was
OL,13,Fproduced to raise funds and awareness
OL,14,Ffor the movement.
OL,16,FToday, surviving examples are
OL,17,F"exceptionally scarce", according to
OL,18,Fantique shop WeBuyVintage, which has
OL,19,Fvalued the item at #2,500.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
